  "label": "Evolutionary Determinism",
  "description": "The text 'after 3 million years of evolution' implies a biological or evolutionary hierarchy, suggesting that despite millions of years of development, humans and gorillas are fundamentally similar in their leisure behavior. This concept, while scientifically inaccurate in its application to human behavior, is a common trope in memes and satire that uses evolutionary biology to make absurd or humorous comparisons. The meme relies on this concept to create its ironic tone, but it also risks reinforcing outdated and simplistic views of human evolution.",
